oirs et ces chemises rouges ?","ar":"كم سعر هذه السراويل السوداء و هذه الأقمصة الحمراء؟"}],"focus":["grimpé","aînée","sauvée","consciente","cuisiné","chemises","Orient","similaires","reviendras","emmenez"],"words":[{"word":"Orient","topic":"L460","difficulty":5,"meaning":"الْمَشْرِق"}],"difficulty":5}}